  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759145,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Classic Books: Alice's Adventures in Wonderland - Nintendo DS\n\nJourney down the rabbit hole with Nintendo's *100 Classic Books: Alice's Adventures in Wonderland* for the Nintendo DS! This unique e-book collection brings Lewis Carroll's beloved tale to life in a portable and interactive format. Hold your DS like a book and immerse yourself in Alice's whimsical world, encountering the Mad Hatter, the Cheshire Cat, and the Queen of Hearts.\n\nThis digital edition retains the charm of the original story while offering modern conveniences. Adjust text size for comfortable reading, personalize your experience with background music, and use the bookmark feature to easily resume your reading. Explore the book with the search function, discovering fascinating details about Carroll and the story's context.  \n\nPart of the larger *100 Classic Book Collection*, this title, developed by Genius Sonority and published by Nintendo, provides a unique way to experience classic literature. Discover a world of adventure, logic puzzles, and unforgettable characters, all within a single DS cartridge. A truly unique and engaging way to rediscover a timeless classic."
    },
